WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:40.610 --> 01:41.860
Vanilla!

01:43.110 --> 01:45.070
Vanilla, don't go!

01:47.070 --> 01:48.490
Vanilla!

01:49.950 --> 01:50.870
Vanilla!!

01:55.920 --> 01:57.420
Vanilla...

02:00.460 --> 02:02.420
The Black Needle of Jealousy.

02:09.680 --> 02:12.890
Hey, Chocolat! Wake up.

02:16.360 --> 02:18.520
Chocolat! Open those eyes!

02:20.230 --> 02:21.570
Vanilla?

02:24.070 --> 02:25.620
Saule?!

02:25.620 --> 02:27.620
W-why are you in here?

02:27.620 --> 02:31.950
"Why?" I'm waking you up because
you oversleep every day.

02:31.950 --> 02:34.540
Look, the weather outside is great.

02:34.540 --> 02:37.130
Get yourself out of bed.
We're eating on the terrace.

02:37.830 --> 02:41.140
Houx made his special chocolate
croissants this morning.

02:41.140 --> 02:43.710
Eh? Chocolate croissants?!?

02:43.710 --> 02:45.630
I'll eat em, I'll eat em!

02:53.100 --> 02:54.770
So tasty~!

02:54.770 --> 02:57.270
I love your chocolate croissants, Houx!

02:57.270 --> 02:59.770
They're enough to get me
up early every morning.

02:59.770 --> 03:01.270
Here, have some café au lait.

03:01.270 --> 03:02.730
Thanks, Houx.

03:02.730 --> 03:05.660
And once again, Houx makes
a great café au lait.

03:07.360 --> 03:11.660
I just wish Vanilla were here eating
these chocolate croissants with us.

03:14.870 --> 03:17.780
I've become the Ogre Princess.

03:18.080 --> 03:22.840
This spell will bring one's
saddest thoughts to the surface.

03:27.430 --> 03:31.390
Oh yeah! Houx, you should show
me how to make these.

03:31.390 --> 03:34.430
That way, I can make them for
Vanilla when she comes back.

03:34.430 --> 03:35.600
Sure thing.

03:35.600 --> 03:39.440
Then I'll master the art of
making a mean café au lait.

03:39.440 --> 03:40.100
Yeah!

03:43.400 --> 03:48.160
By the way, Saule has club stuff to
do today, but I'll walk you home.

03:48.160 --> 03:49.410
Sorry about that.

03:49.410 --> 03:51.380
I didn't think I'd
enjoy basketball this much.

03:51.700 --> 03:53.580
Hey, that's great.

03:53.580 --> 03:57.620
You guys don't really need to
walk me home every day.

03:57.620 --> 03:59.620
I can get back on my own.

04:01.040 --> 04:02.090
Huh?

04:02.740 --> 04:04.130
It's Mayu-chan.

04:04.130 --> 04:05.920
She's from your class, right?

04:05.920 --> 04:06.720
Yep.

04:07.430 --> 04:10.390
Walking to school as a couple...
way to go, Mayu!

04:10.390 --> 04:12.350
When did that happen?

04:12.350 --> 04:16.310
Actually, it's pretty much nothing
but couples around here.

04:16.870 --> 04:18.360
It's true!

04:18.730 --> 04:21.810
Oh yeah, Nanako-chan told me
how she's all lovey-dovey...

04:21.810 --> 04:24.400
with some guy she met
on the road to school.

04:24.940 --> 04:27.570
That's right, the road to school
is the place to meet someone.

04:27.570 --> 04:28.740
Meet "someone"...?

04:29.110 --> 04:34.250
However, you shouldn't get your hopes
up since you've always got escorts.

04:34.580 --> 04:35.330
Huh?

04:38.000 --> 04:39.960
Huh? Where's Chocolat?

04:39.960 --> 04:42.670
Hey, where'd she run off to?

04:43.840 --> 04:46.270
Sorry Houx, Saule...

04:46.270 --> 04:50.270
but I don't stand a chance of meeting
anyone when I'm with you guys.

04:53.770 --> 04:56.730
All that dashing around's
left me thirsty.

04:56.730 --> 05:00.350
Chocolat, there's an ice cream
truck parked over there!

05:00.350 --> 05:02.270
Buy some Chocolate Mint for me!

05:02.270 --> 05:03.860
Okay, Duke!

05:04.480 --> 05:07.280
Excuse me! Can I have two
Chocolate Mint cones please!

05:07.860 --> 05:09.160
Very well, here they are.

05:09.160 --> 05:10.360
That will be 460 yen.

05:10.360 --> 05:11.790
Okay!

05:11.790 --> 05:13.370
Oh no!

05:13.370 --> 05:14.870
I don't have any money.

05:14.870 --> 05:15.290
What?

05:15.660 --> 05:16.660
Will this be okay?

05:17.960 --> 05:19.710
Don't worry about the change.

05:19.710 --> 05:20.790
Okay then.

05:22.300 --> 05:25.380
T-thank you very much.

05:27.590 --> 05:29.630
This is your chance to meet someone!

05:29.630 --> 05:31.340
Or at least it was...

05:31.340 --> 05:33.430
Oh crap!

05:33.430 --> 05:37.810
And I'm supposed to be collecting as many
hearts as I can for the Queen Exam...

05:40.350 --> 05:41.860
Big news, everybody!

05:41.860 --> 05:43.440
Get a load of this!

05:43.440 --> 05:47.320
Pierre-sama's going to have an exhibition
fencing match after school today!

05:47.320 --> 05:49.530
Oh yeah, it's a tradition.

05:49.530 --> 05:52.530
Let's go watch! You in, Chocolat?

05:58.960 --> 06:02.840
Vanilla's eyes are looking more
and more like Pierre's.

06:04.840 --> 06:08.880
Vanilla-chan, wanna come with
me today after school?

06:08.880 --> 06:11.430
There's this great flower arrangement
you've just got to see!

06:11.430 --> 06:13.970
No, no! Let me walk you home!

06:13.970 --> 06:15.810
I found this really trendy coffee house!

06:16.140 --> 06:18.060
Oh, I'm sooo torn.

06:18.060 --> 06:19.850
Eeny meanie, meiny moe...

06:26.110 --> 06:29.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

06:35.210 --> 06:37.340
Noir, gather to me!

06:51.620 --> 06:52.330
Vanilla...

06:57.520 --> 06:58.930
Go for it!

06:59.810 --> 07:01.870
Give him hell!

07:03.150 --> 07:05.480
Pierre-sama, do your best!

07:05.480 --> 07:07.610
Looking good, Pierre-sama!

07:07.900 --> 07:10.610
Takamura-sempai, I'm
behind you all the way!

07:22.170 --> 07:24.210
C'est fini! Match Over!

07:29.010 --> 07:30.220
Good game.

07:31.510 --> 07:33.890
I'll be defeating you next time.

07:33.890 --> 07:35.890
Wouldn't miss it for the world.

07:38.220 --> 07:40.100
Pierre-sama!

07:41.850 --> 07:44.400
Hey, didn't I meet
that guy this morning?

07:44.400 --> 07:46.540
Oh! It's a destined reunion!

07:46.540 --> 07:46.980
Huh?

07:47.400 --> 07:50.990
Use the money you borrowed
as an excuse to talk to him.

07:50.990 --> 07:53.910
I see! I wouldn't wanna be
a deadbeat, after all...

07:57.910 --> 07:58.740
Aren't you...?

07:59.540 --> 08:02.710
Here. Thanks for lending me
this money earlier today.

08:04.420 --> 08:06.290
60 yen isn't enough.

08:07.340 --> 08:09.260
Are you slow in the head?

08:09.760 --> 08:10.970
I don't need the money.

08:10.970 --> 08:12.550
I wasn't thinking of it as a loan.

08:12.550 --> 08:13.470
Later.

08:15.010 --> 08:16.600
Meanie!

08:16.600 --> 08:20.680
All right, time to give him a
taste of his own medicine.

08:22.520 --> 08:25.440
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

08:29.110 --> 08:29.450
Wand!

08:38.950 --> 08:40.120
All righty!

08:41.000 --> 08:43.210
Brille Etoile!

08:49.340 --> 08:50.130
Yeess?

08:52.550 --> 08:55.180
You're the sparkliest guy I've ever seen!

08:55.180 --> 08:58.470
Here you are, 460 yen, all present
and accounted for.

09:00.100 --> 09:03.310
I'm sorry for calling you slow earlier.

09:03.310 --> 09:06.270
This morning, I fell in love
with you at first sight.

09:06.270 --> 09:09.650
Then when you suddenly appeared
again, I didn't know what to think.

09:10.610 --> 09:13.610
Would you mind terribly if you
and I went out together?

09:15.110 --> 09:18.620
No way, Brille Etoile
worked a little too well...

09:25.540 --> 09:27.420
Did you see Chocolat just now?

09:27.420 --> 09:30.460
You'd think she'd be
sad about losing you.

09:30.460 --> 09:33.380
But no, she's kept on collecting hearts
without a care in the world.

09:34.800 --> 09:39.390
I won't lose. I won't
let Chocolat beat me.

09:40.770 --> 09:42.890
Chocolat's pretty late.

09:43.640 --> 09:46.020
Did she get distracted
by something shiny?

09:46.020 --> 09:49.230
She wasn't in the classroom
when I went to pick her up.

09:49.230 --> 09:52.530
I was sure she'd
gone home ahead of me.

09:52.530 --> 09:54.280
Did something happen to her?

09:54.280 --> 09:55.530
I'm home!

09:55.530 --> 09:56.990
What took you so long, Chocolat?

09:56.990 --> 09:58.360
We were starting to worry.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.450
Huh?

09:59.450 --> 10:00.580
Who's that?

10:00.580 --> 10:02.460
His name is Takamura-kun.

10:02.460 --> 10:03.960
I met this morning.

10:03.960 --> 10:07.250
We stayed at the park for a little too
long, so he walked me home.

10:07.250 --> 10:09.880
I am sorry for having made you worry.

10:09.880 --> 10:11.920
I apologize from the bottom of my heart.

10:11.920 --> 10:13.840
Allow me to take my leave here.

10:15.800 --> 10:18.010
I'm gonna go change clothes.

10:19.510 --> 10:22.100
Something about that guy just bugs me.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.190
I don't like him.

10:23.190 --> 10:25.850
Well, he did walk Chocolat home...

10:25.850 --> 10:28.520
It's not like he's her boyfriend.
I can't stand him!

10:28.520 --> 10:30.780
Well, Chocolat is a Queen Candidate,

10:30.780 --> 10:33.320
and sometimes she has to do whatever
it takes to collect hearts.

10:33.320 --> 10:35.040
This is one of those times.

10:35.040 --> 10:38.110
But this is just plain wrong!

10:50.170 --> 10:51.250
Takamura-kun?

10:52.090 --> 10:53.260
Hey.

10:53.260 --> 10:55.430
The weather looked really nice today,

10:55.430 --> 10:58.010
so I thought I'd see if you wanted
to walk to school with me.

11:01.550 --> 11:03.940
His heart is already pink.

11:03.940 --> 11:06.560
Brille Etoile is still working.

11:11.060 --> 11:15.660
And just when I'd finished
baking chocolate croissants.

11:15.660 --> 11:18.390
Guess I'll just have to give
them to her at lunch.

11:18.390 --> 11:23.040
That's nothing. I just learned how
to make café au lait this morning!

11:26.040 --> 11:31.300
Say, have you ever had this store's
croissants? They're first-rate.

11:31.300 --> 11:35.550
Nope, the only croissants I eat are
the ones Houx makes for me.

11:35.550 --> 11:37.760
By "Houx," you mean someone
at your house?

11:37.760 --> 11:38.280
Yeah.

11:38.640 --> 11:41.100
Are they your relatives or something?

11:41.100 --> 11:45.440
More or less. We've played together
ever since we were little.

11:45.440 --> 11:50.190
Really? You must feel blessed to
have two handsome knights.

11:51.320 --> 11:54.530
How can Takamura smile so beautifully?

11:55.650 --> 11:59.530
Say, this flower shop makes
some very lovely bouquets.

12:00.030 --> 12:03.040
If you want to buy flowers for someone
special, this is the place.

12:04.210 --> 12:05.290
And he knows so much.

12:06.620 --> 12:09.750
Ah, Chopin, you're looking lively today.

12:11.550 --> 12:12.750
And he's kind, to boot.

12:20.560 --> 12:22.100
Somehow, being with Takamura-kun...

12:22.100 --> 12:25.760
made the ordinary walk to school
into something extraordinary.

12:29.520 --> 12:32.650
I hope you'll be your extremely
cheerful self today, too.

12:32.650 --> 12:34.150
Sure. See ya!

12:35.530 --> 12:40.030
If possible, I'd like to be with you
outside of school hours as well.

12:41.030 --> 12:44.540
I'll come pick you up for the
walk home. Goodbye.

12:54.420 --> 12:57.290
Hey, what's gotten you two so riled up?

12:57.290 --> 12:59.640
We're not exactly "angry"...

12:59.640 --> 13:01.430
No, I am exactly angry.

13:01.430 --> 13:02.770
So what's this about?

13:02.770 --> 13:06.190
It's about you letting that
sleazy guy kiss you!

13:06.190 --> 13:07.770
And you didn't even collect his heart.

13:09.110 --> 13:10.560
Don't be like that, Saule.

13:10.560 --> 13:13.320
Chocolat is free
to do whatever she wants.

13:13.320 --> 13:15.530
No one can restrict her actions.

13:15.530 --> 13:16.810
Not even us.

13:16.810 --> 13:18.990
But I don't like what I don't like.

13:18.990 --> 13:22.820
I'm not as understanding
as you are, Houx. Later!

13:22.820 --> 13:27.670
Saule's making too big a deal
about me and Takamura.

13:27.670 --> 13:29.280
Is he, really?

13:29.280 --> 13:32.670
From the look on your face, I'd
say you enjoyed that kiss.

13:33.830 --> 13:35.920
Sorry, I'll see you later.

13:43.800 --> 13:46.300
Thus begins a descent into Hell.

13:46.300 --> 13:50.730
The boy who got close to Chocolat is
Takamura from Hainan Jr. High.

13:50.730 --> 13:52.320
Don't be fooled by his cool appearance.

13:52.320 --> 13:53.820
He can be very jealous.

13:53.820 --> 13:57.820
I've crossed swords with him many
times, so I know him well.

13:57.820 --> 13:59.610
He's very jealous of me.

13:59.610 --> 14:03.580
A human, jealous of you?
He doesn't know his own limits.

14:03.580 --> 14:05.080
He's jealous because he's human.

14:05.620 --> 14:08.210
Vanilla, the seed has been planted.

14:08.210 --> 14:12.600
Use it to make our carefree Chocolat
experience the Hell of jealousy.

14:13.460 --> 14:16.100
I'm quite sure she hasn't tasted it yet.

14:22.350 --> 14:25.640
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

14:30.980 --> 14:33.230
It's time to do this, Vanilla.

14:33.230 --> 14:35.690
Time to show just how well
you've learned from Pierre.

14:36.240 --> 14:38.490
Jalousie Aiguille!

14:47.410 --> 14:50.880
Hey, I have to know, Chocolat...

14:50.880 --> 14:54.250
Are you dating Takamura-kun
from Hainan Jr. High?

14:55.420 --> 14:57.510
I wouldn't say I'm "dating" him...

14:57.510 --> 15:00.940
But everybody's talking about him kissing
you by the school gate this morning.

15:02.810 --> 15:05.930
So, are you two the ones
spreading rumors about me?

15:05.930 --> 15:06.890
Crap!

15:06.890 --> 15:08.190
She's gonna hit us!

15:08.190 --> 15:10.180
Run away!

15:08.190 --> 15:10.180
Run for your life!

15:10.180 --> 15:12.190
But it's not all bad.

15:12.190 --> 15:15.860
I heard that Takamura-kun is the heir
to the Takamura Organization.

15:15.860 --> 15:18.450
He's like the Pierre-sama
of Hainan High!

15:18.450 --> 15:19.700
You're so lucky, Chocolat.

15:19.700 --> 15:23.410
Like I said, I'm not "dating" him!

15:24.190 --> 15:26.410
Chocolat, let's go home.

15:26.410 --> 15:29.290
Saule, don't you have
club activities today?

15:29.290 --> 15:32.790
I'm skipping. I wanna
go home with you.

15:32.790 --> 15:34.840
Besides, we had a fight this morning.

15:34.840 --> 15:37.920
Tonight, I'll make your favorite:
chicken pot pie.

15:37.920 --> 15:39.300
All right!

15:42.220 --> 15:45.470
I can't wait to eat chicken pot pie.

15:45.470 --> 15:47.220
Let me help you make it.

15:50.060 --> 15:51.970
It's you...

15:54.180 --> 15:56.650
Why are you with those boys?

15:56.650 --> 15:59.360
Didn't I say I'll come pick
you up after school?

15:59.360 --> 16:00.740
C'mon, let's go.

16:02.490 --> 16:03.840
Wait, Takamura...!

16:03.840 --> 16:04.440
What is it?

16:05.200 --> 16:08.460
Sorry, I'm going with them today.

16:08.460 --> 16:11.880
Have you forgotten? Since
we go to separate schools,

16:11.880 --> 16:14.450
we're spending all our free time
outside of school together.

16:14.800 --> 16:15.670
But...

16:15.670 --> 16:18.590
Hey! You don't get to decide for her.

16:18.590 --> 16:20.720
Didn't you hear Chocolat say no?

16:20.720 --> 16:24.170
Not to be rude, but I'd like you
to respect Chocolat's feelings.

16:24.930 --> 16:27.810
Shut up! My girlfriend is mine!

16:27.810 --> 16:31.810
Listen, I'd rather you didn't speak
to other boys too much.

16:31.810 --> 16:33.730
No eye contact, either!

16:33.730 --> 16:37.190
You must never be interested
in any guy, except for me!

16:37.780 --> 16:39.680
Takamura, what's gotten into you?

16:40.820 --> 16:42.220
A black heart?

16:46.580 --> 16:47.910
Vanilla?

16:49.440 --> 16:53.920
Could it be that Vanilla used
magic on Takamura?

16:59.450 --> 17:01.970
So what're you going to do, Chocolat?

17:01.970 --> 17:06.600
We got rid of him today, but he'll
be back for more tomorrow.

17:06.600 --> 17:10.210
And unfortunately, we don't have any
way to dispel the Ogre magic.

17:10.560 --> 17:13.610
But, we can't just leave him this way.

17:13.610 --> 17:15.230
We have to do something about it!

17:17.820 --> 17:21.240
How can we turn Takamura
back to normal?

17:24.580 --> 17:26.950
Mama...

17:26.950 --> 17:30.500
What would you do
if you were in my shoes?

17:53.810 --> 17:54.900
This is...

17:58.900 --> 18:00.940
This just might work!

18:02.320 --> 18:05.980
Good morning! Wanna walk
to school together today?

18:05.980 --> 18:07.870
You're up early, Chocolat.

18:07.870 --> 18:11.750
Are you sure? That Takamura guy
might come for you again.

18:11.750 --> 18:15.210
Don't worry, I've got it all planned out.

18:17.250 --> 18:18.920
Did you know?

18:18.920 --> 18:23.090
The stray cat who lives in
that alley had kittens!

18:23.090 --> 18:24.510
I wanna see them!

18:24.510 --> 18:25.510
I bet they're cute.

18:29.140 --> 18:31.460
What's the meaning of this, Chocolat?

18:32.940 --> 18:35.670
Didn't we decide you'd be walking
to school with me?

18:36.110 --> 18:39.230
"We" didn't decide that; you did.

18:39.230 --> 18:41.280
Let's go, Houx, Saule.

18:53.440 --> 18:55.960
Chocolat, it's him.

18:55.960 --> 18:58.460
He cut us off at the pass.

19:03.430 --> 19:06.470
You thought that you could
escape from my love?

19:08.160 --> 19:11.100
Takamura, what you're
feeling isn't love.

19:11.100 --> 19:12.170
What are you saying?

19:12.170 --> 19:14.670
This is just you
being infatuated with me!

19:15.610 --> 19:16.670
No!

19:17.230 --> 19:20.320
We were going out!
We loved each other!

19:20.320 --> 19:22.440
You'd throw all of that away?

19:23.910 --> 19:26.870
I never really liked you
in the first place.

19:26.870 --> 19:28.640
Being with Houx and Saule
is a lot more fun!

19:29.040 --> 19:29.950
What was that?!

19:31.000 --> 19:33.920
Hey, Chocolat, you don't
have to go that far...

19:33.920 --> 19:34.950
Oh yes I do.

19:35.380 --> 19:40.190
I'll keep on being close to Houx
and Saule, forever and ever.

19:40.630 --> 19:42.170
How can you say that?!

19:42.720 --> 19:45.300
Now! Aggrandisement!

19:45.300 --> 19:47.900
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

19:57.360 --> 19:58.230
Wand!

20:08.240 --> 20:09.450
All righty!

20:10.500 --> 20:11.950
Chocolat, what are you doing?

20:11.950 --> 20:14.400
If you take a black heart,
your life is over!

20:14.400 --> 20:15.860
Don't stop me!

20:19.660 --> 20:21.820
Your heart...

20:23.720 --> 20:25.140
pick up!

20:30.140 --> 20:31.390
Chocolat!

20:37.900 --> 20:39.230
It bounced away?

20:39.230 --> 20:40.880
The holder couldn't contain the heart?

20:46.910 --> 20:48.660
Thank goodness!

20:48.660 --> 20:53.000
Don't tell me you made him
more jealous on purpose...

20:53.000 --> 20:55.460
so that the black heart
would get bigger?

20:55.460 --> 20:59.420
Yeah, I was betting on the pendant
deflecting the heart away.

20:59.730 --> 21:01.210
Are you insane?

21:01.210 --> 21:02.920
I was so worried.

21:02.920 --> 21:05.930
Sorry, you two. And thanks!

21:07.410 --> 21:13.270
Because you're with me, I can take all kinds of crazy risks and not break a sweat.

21:13.270 --> 21:15.920
You guys are the best Chevaliers ever!

21:16.190 --> 21:17.230
Chocolat...

21:18.020 --> 21:19.570
I've fallen for you all over again!

21:24.030 --> 21:25.050
Huh?

21:25.050 --> 21:26.760
Takamura...

21:26.760 --> 21:28.990
Thanks for walking me back.

21:28.990 --> 21:32.620
It's the same road I take to school
every day, but you've made it fun!

21:32.620 --> 21:34.120
Glad to hear it.

21:34.120 --> 21:37.460
I hope you'll be your extremely
cheerful self today, too.

21:37.460 --> 21:38.670
See you later!

21:38.670 --> 21:39.560
I will. Good bye!

21:41.020 --> 21:44.050
I'm so glad Takamura-kun's
back to his normal self.

21:44.720 --> 21:49.050
I'll never make a Noir heart
grow big again,

21:49.560 --> 21:52.680
because that is not real love.

21:53.480 --> 21:55.940
You're not half bad, Chocolat.

21:55.940 --> 21:57.400
Pierre...

21:57.400 --> 22:01.070
I'm anticipating our next
battle even more now.

22:01.070 --> 22:05.070
I believe in Vanilla,
and don't you forget it!

22:05.070 --> 22:06.800
I'll take her back, no matter what!

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:46.130 --> 23:48.190
Houx baked some croissants.

23:48.190 --> 23:51.550
But Natsume and the girls are on a diet, so they can't eat them.

23:51.550 --> 23:53.870
But they're soooo good...

23:53.870 --> 23:56.750
That's when you use non-fattening spice?

23:56.750 --> 23:58.080
What the heck is that?

23:58.080 --> 24:01.080
But they seem to like it well enough.

24:01.840 --> 24:05.510
Hey, everyone's acting weird!

24:05.510 --> 24:07.510
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.510 --> 24:10.340
Showdown with Vanilla! The Secret Spice.

24:11.010 --> 24:12.980
Watch it or else I'll whup your butt!

24:12.980 --> 24:13.980
Thanks!
